[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0010","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0020","text":"真的是学校！\n在学校过夜什么的，超级让人心跳加速呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0030","text":"制作人！／制作人大人／制作人！／制作人！／制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0040","text":"好，拍到了一张不错的照片\n接下来到练习前都是自由时间！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0050","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0060","text":"……呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0070","text":"好耶！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0090","text":"哇！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0100","text":"！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0110","text":"……\n真是的，太兴奋了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0120","text":"大家快看！\n黑板是滑动的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0130","text":"说“别太兴奋”的是谁来着……\n真是的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0140","text":"对夏叶来说这种普通的学校很稀奇吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0150","text":"《枕头大战》《试胆大会》《篝火晚会》\n各位，还有其他想做的吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0160","text":"没问题！果穗老师！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0170","text":"呵呵……快乐的计划……\n排得满满当当……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0180","text":"不过，要全部做完的话\n休息时间要尽量缩短哦！大家做好觉悟了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03010000_01_0190","text":"哦——！"}]
